  "note": "NVIDIA's tri-hybrid Mamba-2/attention/MoE stack: 52 blocks whose kinds the GGUF's two per-layer lists state \u2014 the six attention blocks (5, 12, 19, 26, 33, 40) mark themselves with head_count_kv 2, the 23 MoE blocks with feed_forward_length 1856, and the 23 blocks stating both 0 are Mamba-2. Its GGUF's tokenizer.ggml.pre=pixtral is Mistral's Tekken split, which the pixtral tokenizer profile rebuilds. GGUF only for the target: no packed format. Its DSpark draft (six causal sliding-window layers, per-head attention sinks and a rank-512 Markov head) ships as safetensors; NVIDIA's MTP nextn block converts via dev/convert/gguf_mtp_to_safetensors.py.",
